        "desc": "<color=#FFD780FF>Radiance: Stellar Swirl</color>: Vesna will gain the corresponding effect based on the Elemental Type of her party members: \\n· For every <color=#99FFFFFF>Cryo</color> or <color=#80FFD7FF>Anemo</color> character in her current party, Vesna's ATK increases by 6%; and\\n· For every character of all other Elemental Types in her current party, Vesna's Elemental Mastery increases by 25 instead.",
