        "desc": "When there are 1/2/3/4 <color=#80C0FFFF>Hydro</color> or <color=#99FFFFFF>Cryo</color> characters in the party, Escoffier will decrease the <color=#80C0FFFF>Hydro RES</color> and <color=#99FFFFFF>Cryo RES</color> of any opponents hit by her Elemental Skill, <color=#FFD780FF>{LINK#S11122}Low-Temperature Cooking{/LINK}</color>, or her Elemental Burst, <color=#FFD780FF>{LINK#S11125}Scoring Cuts{/LINK}</color>, by 5%/10%/15%/55% for 12s.",
