        "level": 1,
        "desc": "You disgorge a meteorite from the depths of the earth, dealing <color=#FFE699FF>AoE Geo DMG</color>.\\nThe meteorite is considered a <color=#FFE699FF>Geo Construct</color>, and can be climbed or used to block attacks.\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>Hold</color>\\nThis skill's positioning may be adjusted.\\n\\n<i>You spoke with Paimon about the final destination of falling stars.</i>",
