        "skill_id": 1121,
        "skill_type": 2,
        "level": 1,
        "desc": "<color=#FFD780FF>Lea Lotus Lamp</color> will obtain one level of Overflowing Lotuslight every second it is on the field, increasing the Elemental Mastery of active character(s) within its AoE by 6. Overflowing Lotuslight has a maximum of 10 stacks.",
        "skill_affix_list": [],
