        "icon": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/hk4e/e20200928calculate/item_icon/6851f3c1/b4b735a9d509de8d7c81287cac5a8d13.png",
        "effect": "Enhances the effects of the Ascension Talent {LINK#N11130008}<color=#FFD780FF>Return to Oblivion</color>{/LINK}: Each Death's Crossing stack also increases Skirk's ATK by 10%/20%/40%.\\nYou must first unlock the Ascension Talent Return to Oblivion.",
