        "skill_id": 10822,
        "skill_type": 1,
        "level": 1,
        "desc": "Controls a Gossamer Sprite that cruises and attacks nearby opponents, dealing <color=#99FF88FF>Dendro DMG</color>.\\nAfter it performs 3 attacks or if there are no opponents nearby, the Sprite will return, healing all nearby party members based on Baizhu's Max HP.\\n\\n<i>Those in the medical field who can read true signs of illness from false ones may even cure people before any symptoms can show.</i>",
