        "skill_type": 1,
        "level": 1,
        "desc": "Qiqi releases the adeptus power sealed within her body, marking nearby opponents with a Fortune-Preserving Talisman that deals <color=#99FFFFFF>Cryo DMG</color>.\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>Fortune-Preserving Talisman</color>\\nWhen opponents affected by this Talisman take DMG, the character that dealt this DMG regenerates HP.\\n\\n<i>\"I am the Fortune Preserver, the Maiden of Resurrection.\"</i>\\n<i>— Qiqi does not remember these words.</i>",
