        "skill_id": 10395,
        "skill_type": 1,
        "level": 4,
        "desc": "Tosses out a special cold brew that deals <color=#99FFFFFF>AoE Cryo DMG</color> and creates a Drunken Mist in an AoE.\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>Drunken Mist</color>\\n·Deals continuous <color=#99FFFFFF>Cryo DMG</color> to opponents within the AoE.\\n·Continuously regenerates the HP of characters within the AoE.\\n\\n<i>A horrific mix that even Diona considers inhumane. The horrifying foretaste should be left for one's opponents. It has a crisp aftertaste, but unfortunately, one can only feel it on one's nose and skin.</i>",
