        "level": 1,
        "desc": "When Fischl hits Oz with a fully-charged Aimed Shot, Oz brings down Thundering Retribution, dealing <color=#FFACFFFF>AoE Electro DMG</color> equal to 152.7% of the arrow's DMG.",
