        "level": 1,
        "desc": "Gain the following effects for 10s after unleashing <color=#FFD780FF>Tidecaller</color> with its maximum DMG Bonus: \\n·DMG dealt by Normal and Charged Attacks is increased by 15%. ATK SPD of Normal and Charged Attacks is increased by 15%.\\n·Greatly reduced delay before unleashing Charged Attacks.",
